  m_text: "Name of the Game: An Era of the Seas  \r\nDeveloped by: Dream Chasers 
    \r\n\r\nProgramming:  \r\n- Achref Ben-Abdallah  \r\n- Ethan Bruno  \r\n- Joseph
    Devin  \r\n- J\xE9r\xF4me Lin  \r\n\r\nArt & Graphics:  \r\n- <link=\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/2d/environments/9-free-backgrounds-285183\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"9
    Free Backgrounds\"</color></link> by Catlands Games  \r\n- <link=\"https://www.vecteezy.com/vector-art/16962878-gold-coins-icons-tokens-for-game-ui-interface\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"Gold
    coins icons, tokens for game ui interface Free Vector\"</color></link> by Yuliya
    Pauliukevich  \r\n- <link=\"https://www.freepik.com/free-vector/hand-drawn-animation-frames-element-collection_32376918.htm\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"Hand
    drawn animation frames element collection\"</color></link> by freepik  \r\n-
    <link=\"https://www.freepik.com/free-vector/stump-log-cartoon-piece-wood-broken-oak-linden-maple-cedar_20366568.htm\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"Stump
    log Cartoon piece of wood Broken oak linden maple cedar\"</color></link> by valadzionak_volha 
    \r\n- <link=\"https://media-public.canva.com/9TFWM/MAF-OH9TFWM/1/tl.png\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"Steal\"</color></link>
    by Canva  \r\n- <link=\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/props/weapons/free-low-poly-swords-189978\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"Free
    Low Poly Swords\"</color></link> by Pure Poly  \r\n- <link=\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/props/weapons/fantasy-sword-25596\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"Fantasy
    Sword\"</color></link> by 3dKingdom  \r\n- <link=\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/props/weapons/free-low-poly-swords-rpg-weapons-198166\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"FREE
    - Low Poly Swords - RPG Weapons\"</color></link> by Blink  \r\n- <link=\"https://free3d.com/fr/3d-model/saber-excalibur-81501.html\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"sabre
    excalibur mod\xE8le 3D\"</color></link> by rito-kun  \r\n- <link=\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/vehicles/sea/poly-angel-mini-pirates-island-267015\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"Poly
    Angel - Mini Pirates Island\"</color></link> by Poly Angel  \r\n- <link=\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/vehicles/sea/stylized-pirate-ship-200192\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"Stylized
