    - PolyPack\"</color></link> by Alstra Infinite  \r\n- <link=\"https://www.pngfind.com/mpng/iiTwhiT_x-pirate-pirate-x-marks-the-spot-hd/\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"x
    mark png\"</color></link> by pngfind  \r\n- <link=\"https://purepng.com/photo/12877/clipart-scar\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"clipart-scar\"</color></link>
    by purepng  \r\n- <link=\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/low-poly-medieval-market-262473\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"Low-Poly
    Medieval Market\"</color></link> by VanillaArt  \r\n- <link=\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/humanoids/lowpoly-survival-character-rio-273074\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"LowPoly
    Survival Character Rio\"</color></link> by VertexModeler Team  \r\n- <link=\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/humanoids/fantasy/free-low-poly-human-rpg-character-219979\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"FREE
    Low Poly Human - RPG Character\"</color></link> by Blink  \r\n- <link=\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/humanoids/humans/free-modular-character-fantasy-rpg-human-male-228952\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"FREE
