    <link=\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/modular-fantasy-character-165896\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"Modular
    Fantasy Character\"</color></link> by asoliddev  \r\n- <link=\"https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/2d/textures-materials/brick-textures-lite-free-289917\"><color=#4AA3DF>\"Brick
